  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Dataset with ArcGIS Dynamic Map Layer, ArcGIS WMS, and direct download. ",
    "This feature dataset shows the distribution and extent of the bedrock geologic units within the State of Illinois, as depicted on the map Bedrock Geology of Illinois (2005) by D. Kolata (compiler), published by the Illinois State Geological Survey. The component feature classes show geologic units (polygons) and faults (lines). The nominal scale of the published hardcopy map is 1:500,000."
